 the legendary Roblox prison roleplay with our all-in-one free automation tool. Whether you play as prisoner, guard, or criminal — take full control of every situation with advanced combat, instant escape routes, and powerful utility features. Updated for the latest Sniper Update and fully working. Paste and play immediately.\n\nFeatures:\n\n[+] Auto Escape Prison - [Automatically navigates the fastest escape route through sewers, break room window, or fence climb without manual input]\n\n[+] Keycard Grab - [Instantly picks up any dropped keycard from guards or the ground and equips it for immediate use on locked doors]\n\n[+] Kill Aura - [Hits all nearby players within a set radius using equipped melee weapons or fists dealing continuous damage automatically]\n\n[+] Anti Arrest - [Prevents guards from using taser or handcuffs on your character making you immune to all arrest attempts]\n\n[+] ESP All Players - [Shows all player names, roles (Prisoner, Guard, Criminal), health bars, equipped weapons, and distance through walls]\n\n[+] Auto Punch - [Rapidly triggers the F key punch attack at maximum speed for instant melee takedowns on guards and other players]\n\n[+] Weapon ESP - [Highlights all weapon spawn locations on the map including Hammer, Crude Knife, MP5, Remington 870, M4A1, and M9]\n\n[+] Noclip - [Allows your character to walk through all walls, doors, fences, and locked areas without needing a keycard]\n\n[+] God Mode - [Eliminates all incoming damage making your character invincible against gunshots, melee attacks, and fall damage]\n\n[+] Teleport to Armory - [Instantly teleports your character inside the armory to grab top-tier weapons like MP5 and Remington 870]\n\n[+] Auto Sprint - [Permanently activates Shift sprint without stamina drain so you move at maximum speed at all times]\n\n[+] Fly - [Enables free flight allowing you to travel over prison walls, fences, and across the entire map without restrictions]\n\n[+] Anti-Fling - [Prevents other players from launching or flinging your character out of bounds during PvP encounters]","tags":["Prison Life","Prison Life Script"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6906a02b925d56977f4c58e5","username":"johnnyzhou69","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"6906a02b925d56977f4c58e5","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T02:33:54.628Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"698638a57a49917a81f1c50f","editBy":{"_id":"6906a02b925d56977f4c58e5","username":"johnnyzhou69","status":"offline","id":"6906a02b925d56977f4c58e5"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-02-06T18:53:25.368Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69863e05fe1749e018668bd0","commentBy":{"_id":"6983679c12004551b6897e23","username":"jakeolies","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-03-01T03:22:23.714Z","createdAt":"2026-02-04T15:37:00.434Z","status":"offline","id":"6983679c12004551b6897e23","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"whoever made this is a literal genius fr fr","edited":false,"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-06T19:16:21.896Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69865c68e186de221e4b1f2c","commentBy":{"_id":"697fcf423b83f72307339ae4","username":"RBXscriptt","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-06-10T18:42:12.163Z","createdAt":"2026-02-01T22:10:10.269Z","status":"offline","id":"697fcf423b83f72307339ae4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.exe